# Claude Code scratch worktrees. Checked-in project config under .claude/
# (settings, agents, skills) is still tracked; only the worktrees are noise.
.claude/worktrees/

# Go build output. The binary is built, never committed.
/drydock

# The web UI's toolchain. The built bundle is NOT ignored: internal/web/dist
# is committed so that `go build` never needs Node (frontend §3).
/web/node_modules/
/web/coverage/

# The browser tier's Playwright output: traces of failed tests, uploaded by CI.
/test/browser/test-results/
